# Whitelist approach: ignore everything by default, only track skill/task logic (.md) and hand-written source code, never business data, generated output, or credentials
*
!*/
!*.md
!*.md.bak*
!.gitignore

# Source code we actually write (dashboard + automation scripts)
!*.py
!*.js
!*.jsx
!*.ts
!*.tsx
!*.mjs
!*.cjs
!*.mts
!*.cts
!*.html
!*.css
!*.ahk
!*.sh
!*.ps1
!*.bat
!*.cmd

# VP Ops Engine (BUILD_SPEC.md Phase 1, "what already exists" row 10):
# heartbeat/latest.json snapshots, launchd plists, and golden-test fixtures
# need to ride this backup too. Scoped to this one project, not a global
# *.json/*.plist whitelist, so it can't pull in data files elsewhere in
# ~/Documents/Claude that are excluded on purpose.
!Projects/VP Ops Engine/vp-ops/**/*.json
!Projects/VP Ops Engine/vp-ops/**/*.plist
!Projects/VP Ops Engine/vp-ops/**/*.txt

# Job I's golden-test fixture is a real Bravo XLSX export -- scoped to just
# tests/fixtures/, NOT a blanket vp-ops/**/*.xlsx (which would start tracking
# live Bravo pull artifacts under data/monthly-analytics/ and output/).
!Projects/VP Ops Engine/vp-ops/tests/fixtures/**/*.xlsx

# Job J's gold_dwt_history.csv is the consolidated backfill (2025 full year +
# 2026 partial, all 5 stores) -- durable, hand-verified data, not a scratch
# artifact. Scoped to data/, not a blanket vp-ops/**/*.csv.
!Projects/VP Ops Engine/vp-ops/data/*.csv

# Extra safety: never track these even if matched above
*.pem
*.key
*.env
.env*
credentials*
*credential*
*token*
*secret*
*password*
brevo_api_key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Generated / dependency / build output -- regenerable, never hand-written, keep out regardless of extension
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.wrangler/
**/.cloudflare/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.cache/
*.pyc

# Explicit hard excludes: personal health data, financial/tax planning docs, vendored tooling, and generated dashboard snapshot history -- never in git, regardless of extension
Projects/Health Optimization/
Projects/Quickbooks Set UP/
tools/
Projects/Business Dashboard Website/site/artifacts/
Artifacts/
